From 4773623d54b53b45a4d8f7521edbc78fd9a443b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JSwetz <Johnswetz1982@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 06:32:59 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mcp): enforce pre-hello deadline and line size limit on
 UI link

Add a 5-second deadline and 4 KiB line limit for unauthenticated UI link
connections before token validation.

Changelog: UI link: drop unauthenticated clients after 5 seconds or 4 KiB before token validation
Fixes #3873
